{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16974","headline":"送李秀才赴滑州诣大夫舅 · 武元衡","name":"送李秀才赴滑州诣大夫舅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陌头车马去翩翩，白面怀书美少年。\n东武杨公姻娅重，西州谢傅舅甥贤。\n长亭叫月新秋雁，官渡含风古树蝉。\n知己满朝留不住，贵臣河上拥旌旃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}